 4. 🤖 Charted: Retail traders buy Nvidia dip 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: FactSet. Chart: Matt Phillips/Axios Everyday investors piled into Nvidia after Jensen Huang's resignation and helped soften the blow to its stock, Axios' Matt Phillips writes. 

 Why it matters: The rush to "buy the dip" shows some investors still believe in the AI boom. 🧮 By the numbers: About 5.1 million call options on Nvidia — bets that its stock will rise — traded Thursday after Huang's resignation was announced.

 That's the second-highest single-day total this year. Get Axios Markets . 

 
 
